			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750090601,
					"content": "戰果如何？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090602,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}找到了這個…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090603,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090604,
					"content": "讓我看看…是不少見但難得的東西。保存完好，燃素流經的紋路也清晰可見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090605,
					"content": "#嗯，如果我出一萬摩拉的話，{F#妳}{M#你}們願意把這個東西交給我嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090606,
					"content": "欸？！難道我們真的找到價值連城的珍貴龍遺物了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090607,
					"content": "#我就知道{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是個了不起的小傢伙，可以為我們帶來好運！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090608,
					"content": "不，這東西並沒有妳想的那麼珍貴。拿去龍遺物研究協會總部鑑定的話，根據我的判斷，充其量也就只值五千摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090609,
					"content": "我才不會上當呢，要是它真的只值五千摩拉，你又怎麼會出一萬收購？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090610,
					"content": "因為我很中意它獨特的紋路。雖然它在別人眼中沒有那麼高的價值，但我願意為了得到它而花費額外的摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090611,
					"content": "可以說是怪癖，也可以說是收藏家的本性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090612,
					"content": "唔…這樣說好像也不是不能理解，而且跟三百摩拉的進場費比，一萬摩拉也算很多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090613,
					"content": "那我們要用它換一萬摩拉嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090614,
					"content": "嗚…嗚嗚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090615,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}看起來不願意的樣子…是想自己留著嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090616,
					"content": "唔…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090617,
						750090618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090617,
					"content": "#畢竟是{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}自己找到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750090619,
					"content": "#既然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}不願意，那我們還是自己留著好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090620,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090621,
					"content": "#看來{F#妳}{M#你}們是看重{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}更甚摩拉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090622,
					"content": "#那當然啦，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也是我們的夥伴嘛。不過如果我們之後找到類似的東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090623,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們，不過收藏家的熱情就像潮水，來得快去得也快。之後大概會迷上別的東西吧？但會是什麼我也不好說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090624,
					"content": "呀！呀呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090625,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}是在贊同她？我懂了，這就是收藏家之間的惺惺相惜吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090626,
					"content": "可以得到這麼聰穎的小嵴鋒龍認可真是榮幸，買賣不成仁義在，今後如果想交流收藏的心得，不妨來找我聊一聊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750090627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 750090627,
					"content": "那就不耽誤各位了，祝好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "奎皮亞"
				},
				{
